cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this R manifest package, cite the package itself. If you use the underlying biological images or analysis outputs, cite BioStudies accession S-BSST3199 according to the BioStudies record. If your analysis relies on the archived metrics-petri software or the U-Net validation dataset, cite the corresponding Harvard Dataverse DOI as well."
title: "grayleafspotdata: File manifest for the S-BSST3199 Magnaporthe colony image dataset"
abstract: "An R data package providing a machine-readable manifest for the research data deposited in EMBL-EBI BioStudies under accession S-BSST3199. The manifest points at the canonical deposited files; the 49 source images are not bundled with the R package."
